riginal_language":"ja","original_name":"TRIGUN","overview":"Trigun takes place in the distant future on a desert planet. Vash the Stampede is a gunfighter with a legend so ruthless he has a $$60,000,000,000 bounty on his head. Entire towns evacuate at the rumor of his arrival. But the real Vash the Stampede, the enigmatic and conflicted lead character, is more heroic, even though he usually acts like a complete idiot.","popularity":31.3208,"poster_path":"/lwLFZFB3S2PeOLtWksaWerF6B4D.jpg","first_air_date":"1998-04-02","softcore":false,"name":"TRIGUN","vote_average":8.068,"vote_count":514},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5NVIijd8tReEDTXyO1rSrz4XTtS.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,16,18,10765],"id":26674,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"ソルティレイ","overview":"It’s been twelve years since the Blast Fall, an unexplained disaster that left countless dead and many more maimed. Society is divided and every citizen feels the burn, most of all the Resembles – people whose mangled bodies have been rebuilt with high-tech prosthetic devices. Bounty hunter Roy Revant has seen it all, walking alone in this shattered city. That is, until the day a strange little girl named Solty falls from the sky straight into his heart. The search for family turns into a search for meaning and those that wield harsh power over society won’t go unnamed for long. Roy and Solty may seek different things… But who wants to search for truth alone?","popularity":9.6348,"poster_path":"/u8ONAAB4eWjn9CkE8s0JPMdcOUN.jpg","first_air_date":"2005-10-07","softcore":false,"name":"Solty Rei","vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":14},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/fWZu2vaHJg7M6iwqeFPO3rMHTi7.jpg","genre_ids":[16,18,10765,10768],"id":27660,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"銀河英雄伝説","overview":"War rages between the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance. With two new brilliant young leaders at the helm, anything can happen in this military space opera.","popularity":29.201,"poster_path":"/j6amUPH88lc7cJf54MKZCf4a9NA.jpg","first_air_date":"1988-01-08","softcore":false,"name":"Legend of the Galactic Heroes","vote_average":8.6,"vote_count":91},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/k8aRUvmyVkbJJgcfzpInZgEDRod.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,9648,10765],"id":88041,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"彼方のアストラ","overview":"In the year 2063, eight high school students and a kid are flown out to Planet Camp, tasked with surviving on their own for a few days. But shortly after arriving, an ominous glowing orb warps them to an unknown quadrant of space, nearly 5,012 light years away. Now, the only way back home is a slow, dangerous trek across the universe—a journey that’ll test them in ways Planet Camp never could.","popularity":9.3375,"poster_path":"/bprvOBSMKxGdI4Egcy3dqMhKytS.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-07-03","softcore":false,"name":"Astra Lost in Space","vote_average":7.7,"vote_count":139},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jIGB53Yto6xOFrFJoOjGKQ9V0ak.jpg","genre_ids":[9648,18,10765],"id":90259,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"The Third Day","overview":"A unique story told over two distinct halves, \"Summer\" follows Sam, a man drawn to a mysterious island off the British coast where he encounters a group of islanders set on preserving their traditions at any cost. \"Winter\" follows Helen, a strong-willed outsider who comes to the island seeking answers, but whose arrival precipitates a fractious battle to decide its fate.","popularity":12.5984,"poster_path":"/cW3xE7FKgkXRE1RdZyvUJIoDBFg.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-09-14","softcore":false,"name":"The Third Day","vote_average":6.5,"vote_count":239},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/63LRRGIWQxvJiW4G1fRyS70ZE6Y.jpg","genre_ids":[35,10759,18],"id":90766,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Teenage Bounty Hunters","overview":"After joining forces with a veteran bounty hunter, sixteen-year-old fraternal twin sisters Sterling and Blair dive into the world of bail skipping baddies while still navigating the high stakes of teenage love and sex.","popularity":7.7791,"poster_path":"/gFtJaWcLAJJsSzfuWcLSeAS8aVl.jpg","first_air_date":"2020-08-14","softcore":false,"name":"Teenage Bounty Hunters","vote_average":7.692,"vote_count":377},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/pzoWsyJm1ud3YqqPK9scilCiPkt.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,18],"id":31424,"origin_country":["KR"],"original_language":"ko","original_name":"추노","overview":"It follows the story of Lee Dae Gil, a man of high birth, whose family was ruined when Won Gi Yun, a slave, burnt down his house and escaped with his sister, Un Nyeon, who was in love with Dae Gil. Driven by his desire for revenge, he survived his harsh years on the street and made his name as a slave hunter, dedicated to his pursuit to find Un Nyun, his first and only love.\n\nSong Tae Ha is a General of the Army who became a slave after being falsely accused of a crime he did not commit and finds himself on the run from Dae Gil's relentless pursuit. Both men become entangled in a love triangle with Un Nyepn, who is no longer a runaway slave, but Kim Hye Won, a nobleman's daughter.","popularity":7.7413,"poster_path":"/j4TL2CKDxUxUKSLwBL89cbUxqoU.jpg","first_air_date":"2010-01-06","softcore":false,"name":"The Slave Hunters","vote_average":8.1,"vote_count":28},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/9hjHVwtHFt03Y6kS9yFXoBI4WK0.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,10765],"id":2443,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Buck Rogers in the 25th Century","overview":"20th-century astronaut Buck Rogers awakens in the 25th century after a freak accident puts him in suspended animation for 500 years. Upon returning to Earth and discovering the planet is recovering from a nuclear war, Buck uses his combat skills and ingenuity to protect Earth and fight evil throughout the galaxy alongside starfighter pilot Colonel Wilma Deering and robot companion Twiki.","popularity":21.3855,"poster_path":"/1SgcheHtEcacQxRFKpIuP0jYw6u.jpg","first_air_date":"1979-09-20","softcore":false,"name":"Buck Rogers in the 25th Century","vote_average":7.1,"vote_count":149},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2bGHf3soBQUQebHv6tJpEGor8mF.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,18,9648,37],"id":31682,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"エル・カザド","overview":"Nadie is a bounty hunter targeting Ellis, a young amnesiac girl who is a suspect in the murder of a famous scientist. Nadie manages to apprehend Ellis, but on a whim, decides to help unlock Ellis's memories.","popularity":7.8644,"poster_path":"/kK6034fgLDVoDyLicUez9M4yckO.jpg","first_air_date":"2007-04-02","softcore":false,"name":"El Cazador de la Bruja","vote_average":6,"vote_count":20},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/jU7aA911z7SrXtjgQOvjDVXcR0q.jpg","genre_ids":[16,10759,18,10765],"id":31709,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"銀河鉄道999","overview":"In a distant future, Tetsuro is a human boy who wants his body replaced with a robotic one. This is possible, but to do so he has to reach the Immortal Planet onboard the space train Galaxy Express 999. Maetel, a beautiful and mysterious blonde woman dressed in Russian style, joins him in the long journey through space. Every episode sees our heroes arriving in a new planet's space train station.","popularity":14.7287,"poster_path":"/hSL8OUYK1TRKENMgrgStaY5lqzK.jpg","first_air_date":"1978-09-14","softcore":false,"name":"Galaxy Express 999","vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":32},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/awA0z4sGI70vvGh0mWKAp7B7U2E.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,16,10765],"id":31714,"origin_country":["JP"],"original_language":"ja","original_name":"宇宙海賊キャプテンハーロック","overview":"When a mysterious invader from the stars catches Earth unawares, only the legendary space pirate Captain Harlock and the crew of the Arcadia have the will to stand against them.","popularity":12.4853,"poster_path":"/1Sgv2IKECoCZNALvH0v2Qic8NsJ.jpg","